NavSlides Editor
================

This product includes design assets adapted from third-party open-source work.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
html-ppt-skill (lewislulu)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Some of the color palettes and typography pairings expressed as design-token
presets in `shared/src/theme-presets.js` were adapted from:

    html-ppt-skill — https://github.com/lewislulu/html-ppt-skill
    Licensed under the MIT License.

Only palette/typography VALUES (facts) were adapted and re-expressed in
NavSlides' own design-token shape (see `shared/src/design-tokens.js`). No source
CSS or markup from html-ppt-skill is bundled or copied into this project.

